— paper/notes prose updates align text to the math the scripts already computed correctly, and the stage 082 closed-form pin produces only verification (no new constants). **New pitfall #10 candidate:** SymPy `sp.nsolve` is unstable for roots near a derivative singularity (`y tan y = 37` overshoots to far roots near `pi/2`); use `mpmath.findroot(..., (1.5, 1.55), solver='bisect')` with bracketing. Promote to `codex.md` if recurs. With III.4 v2 closed, **entire range 001-084 is now paper-aligned at v2 depth**. See `redteam/batches/batch_III4_v2.md`, `redteam/resolutions/batch_III4_paper_alignment.md` (3 substantive Codex-evidenced recommendations with orchestrator-direct apply logs). |
