/var/projects/toy_physics/research/pde_ledger/notes/stages/review/stage_131_review.md:53:6. **Physical interpretation.** Sound. Isotropic shift (from U doublet) vs directional rank-1 load (from BdG + mixed) has clear physical meaning. beta_0 >= 0 (ratio of squares) ensures nonnegative transfer factor.
