/var/projects/toy_physics/research/pde_ledger/notes/stages/review/stage_106_review.md:43:1. **Equation-level correctness.** Five dimensionless ratios (eps_eta, eps_W, rho, Z_W, delta_0) plus Lambda correctly defined from Stage-20 continuum formulas. Placement formulas verified: delta = delta_0/(1-eps_eta), M_mix = 8 Z_W(1+rho)^2/(pi^2(1-eps_eta)(1-eps_W)). Product relation R_target * M_mix = 8 Lambda(1-eps_W)/pi^2 verified — Z_W, (1+rho)^2, (1-eps_eta) cancel exactly. All nine derivative factorizations verified by hand.
/var/projects/toy_physics/research/pde_ledger/notes/stages/review/stage_106_review.md:60:- The dimensionless reduction is algebraically correct. Substituting the Stage 20 continuum formulas into `delta`, `M_mix`, and `R_target` gives exactly the stated five-ratio map in `(eps_eta, eps_W, rho, Z_W, delta_0)` plus `Lambda`.
/var/projects/toy_physics/research/pde_ledger/notes/stages/review/stage_106_review.md:65:- The beta-factor rewrite is compatible with the Stage 20 kernel formulas: only the mass ratio `mu_W/mu_eta` survives in `beta_0`, while the placement variables themselves are pure stiffness/coupling ratios.
/var/projects/toy_physics/research/pde_ledger/notes/stages/review/stage_168_review.md:43:1. **Equation-level correctness.** All verified: overlap integrals match prior stages, sigma/kappa_0^2 = 11/9 correct. Reduced coupling structure follows from mode expansions. Schur complement Sigma_wall = Xi I_2 + alpha v v^T correct (Xi from diagonal U-U, alpha from BdG + mixed). Source coupling and projection J_- = g_Q Q_STF (v.e_-) correct. Source map mhat_-^2 = s_-/kappa_0^2. Bound 1 <= mhat_-^2 < 11/9 from monotonic s_- growth. Elimination mhat_-^2 * P_{0,-} = beta_0 s_-^2/(kappa_0^2 lambda_-) by direct substitution.
/var/projects/toy_physics/research/pde_ledger/notes/stages/review/stage_168_review.md:53:6. **Physical interpretation.** Sound: source amplification modest (~22%), normalization burden on lambda_- and beta_0.
